[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18363.19, "timestamp": "05:06:03", "text": "所以，呃，上周，我是说，上周"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18365.67, "timestamp": "05:06:05", "text": "是这周还是上周？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18369.11, "timestamp": "05:06:09", "text": "上周，我们没能做到“是的，我当时……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18372.59, "timestamp": "05:06:12", "text": "正要说呢。我正要说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18376.47, "timestamp": "05:06:16", "text": "它。就像上周或这周一样，呃，我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18379.67, "timestamp": "05:06:19", "text": "无法同时直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18382.708, "timestamp": "05:06:22", "text": "是的。是的。另外，Apex 也正在进行中。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18384.868, "timestamp": "05:06:24", "text": "正确的？是的。我们完全可以做到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18387.11, "timestamp": "05:06:27", "text": "是的。我们也可以这样做。该活动是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18389.31, "timestamp": "05:06:29", "text": "在那里待了一周。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18398.03, "timestamp": "05:06:38", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18401.27, "timestamp": "05:06:41", "text": "所以你们觉得我为什么会这样？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18404.31, "timestamp": "05:06:44", "text": "在这次谈话中我注意力分散了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18411.27, "timestamp": "05:06:51", "text": "嗯，我说话的时候是不是走神了？"}]